{"id":"trista","lemma":"триста","pos":"num","rank":4016,"glosses":["three hundred (300)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/26/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Дайте им триста долларов.","en":"Give them the $300.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283209","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"он"},null,null]},{"text":"Ты должна нам триста долларов.","en":"You owe us three hundred dollars.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,null]},{"text":"Это стоило мне триста долларов.","en":"It cost me three hundred dollars.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to cost","l":"стоить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Я попросил триста долларов.","en":"I asked for three hundred dollars.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to ask for, to request","l":"попросить"},null,null]},{"text":"Я хочу свои триста долларов обратно.","en":"I want my three hundred dollars back.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null,null,{"g":"back, backwards"}]}]}